#: ../../../../CHANGES.md:596
msgid ""
"This release also bumps `pathspec` to v1 and fixes inconsistencies with "
"Git's `.gitignore` logic ([#4958](https://github.com/psf/black/pull/4958)). "
"Now, files will be ignored if a pattern matches them, even if the parent "
"directory is directly unignored. For example, Black would previously format "
"`exclude/not_this/foo.py` with this `.gitignore`:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../CHANGES.md:601
msgid ""
"exclude/\n"
"!exclude/not_this/\n"
