"pull/4176))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../CHANGES.md:1017
msgid "Version 24.1.0"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../CHANGES.md:1021
msgid ""
"This release introduces the new 2024 stable style ([#4106](https://"
"github.com/psf/black/pull/4106)), stabilizing the following changes:"
