msgstr ""

#: ../../../../CHANGES.md:1037
msgid ""
"Fix bug in line length calculations for power operations ([#3942](https://"
"github.com/psf/black/pull/3942))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../CHANGES.md:1038 ../../../../CHANGES.md:1398
msgid ""
"Add trailing commas to collection literals even if there's a comment after "
