msgstr ""

#: ../../../../CHANGES.md:1040 ../../../../CHANGES.md:1645
msgid ""
"When using `--skip-magic-trailing-comma` or `-C`, trailing commas are "
"stripped from subscript expressions with more than 1 element ([#3209]"
"(https://github.com/psf/black/pull/3209))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../CHANGES.md:1042
msgid ""
"Add extra blank lines in stubs in a few cases ([#3564](https://github.com/"
"psf/black/pull/3564), [#3862](https://github.com/psf/black/pull/3862))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../CHANGES.md:1043
msgid ""
"Accept raw strings as docstrings ([#3947](https://github.com/psf/black/pull/"
"3947))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../CHANGES.md:1044
msgid ""
"Split long lines in case blocks ([#4024](https://github.com/psf/black/pull/"
"4024))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../CHANGES.md:1045
msgid ""
"Stop removing spaces from walrus operators within subscripts ([#3823]"
"(https://github.com/psf/black/pull/3823))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../CHANGES.md:1046
msgid ""
"Fix incorrect formatting of certain async statements ([#3609](https://"
"github.com/psf/black/pull/3609))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../CHANGES.md:1047
msgid ""
"Allow combining `# fmt: skip` with other comments ([#3959](https://"
"github.com/psf/black/pull/3959))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../CHANGES.md:1049
msgid ""
"There are already a few improvements in the `--preview` style, which are "
"slated for the 2025 stable style. Try them out and [share your feedback]"
"(https://github.com/psf/black/issues). In the past, the preview style has "
"included some features that we were not able to stabilize. This year, we're "
"adding a separate `--unstable` style for features with known problems. Now, "
"the `--preview` style only includes features that we actually expect to make "
"it into next year's stable style."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../CHANGES.md:1059
msgid ""
"Several bug fixes were made in features that are moved to the stable style "
"in this release:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../CHANGES.md:1062
msgid ""
"Fix comment handling when parenthesising conditional expressions ([#4134]"
"(https://github.com/psf/black/pull/4134))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../CHANGES.md:1063
msgid ""
"Fix bug where spaces were not added around parenthesized walruses in "
"subscripts, unlike other binary operators ([#4109](https://github.com/psf/"
"black/pull/4109))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../CHANGES.md:1065
msgid ""
"Remove empty lines before docstrings in async functions ([#4132](https://"
"github.com/psf/black/pull/4132))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../CHANGES.md:1066
msgid ""
"Address a missing case in the change to allow empty lines at the beginning "
"of all blocks, except immediately before a docstring ([#4130](https://"
"github.com/psf/black/pull/4130))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../CHANGES.md:1068
msgid ""
"For stubs, fix logic to enforce empty line after nested classes with bodies "
"([#4141](https://github.com/psf/black/pull/4141))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../CHANGES.md:1072
msgid ""
"Add `--unstable` style, covering preview features that have known problems "
"that would block them from going into the stable style. Also add the `--"
"enable-unstable-feature` flag; for example, use `--enable-unstable-feature "
"hug_parens_with_braces_and_square_brackets` to apply this preview feature "
"throughout 2024, even if a later Black release downgrades the feature to "
"unstable ([#4096](https://github.com/psf/black/pull/4096))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../CHANGES.md:1078
msgid ""
"Format module docstrings the same as class and function docstrings ([#4095]"
"(https://github.com/psf/black/pull/4095))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../CHANGES.md:1079
msgid ""
"Fix crash when using a walrus in a dictionary ([#4155](https://github.com/"
"psf/black/pull/4155))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../CHANGES.md:1080
msgid ""
"Fix unnecessary parentheses when wrapping long dicts ([#4135](https://"
"github.com/psf/black/pull/4135))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../CHANGES.md:1081
msgid ""
"Stop normalizing spaces before `# fmt: skip` comments ([#4146](https://"
"github.com/psf/black/pull/4146))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../CHANGES.md:1085
msgid ""
"Print warning when configuration in `pyproject.toml` contains an invalid key "
