msgid ""
"Fix bug where `# fmt: off` automatically dedents when used with the `--line-"
"ranges` option, even when it is not within the specified line range. ([#4084]"
"(https://github.com/psf/black/pull/4084))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../CHANGES.md:1119
msgid ""
"Fix feature detection for parenthesized context managers ([#4104](https://"
"github.com/psf/black/pull/4104))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../CHANGES.md:1123
msgid ""
"Prefer more equal signs before a break when splitting chained assignments "
"([#4010](https://github.com/psf/black/pull/4010))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../CHANGES.md:1124
msgid ""
"Standalone form feed characters at the module level are no longer removed "
